{
  "$comment": "Fallback heuristics for unknown platforms (and for logical fields the platform map missed). detect.js scores every input/select/textarea: autocomplete attribute (weight 1.0), name/id token match (0.8), label/placeholder/aria-label text match (0.6). Score >= threshold fills; below goes to `unresolved`. Shipping vs billing is disambiguated by the nearest ancestor whose class/id/data-* contains a containerHints token.",
